  "prose": [
    {
      "title": "Animations",
      "text": "Bootstrap offers two animation styles for spinners. The animation style\ncan be configured with the `animation` property. An animation style\nmust always be provided when creating a spinner.\n\n** Border Spinner - `border`**\n\n** Grow Spinner - `grow` **",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Variants",
      "text": "All standard visual variants are available for both animation styles by\nsetting the `variant` property. Alternatively spinners can be custom\nsized with the `style` property, or custom CSS classes.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Sizing",
      "text": "In addition to the standard size, a smaller additional preconfigured\nsize is available by configuring the `size` property to `sm`.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Buttons",
      "text": "Like the original Bootstrap spinners, these can also be used with\nbuttons. To use this component out-of-the-box it is recommended you\nchange the element type to `span` by configuring the `as` property when\nusing spinners inside buttons.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accessibility",
      "text": "To ensure the maximum accessibility for spinner components it is\nrecommended you provide a relevant ARIA `role` property,\nand include screenreader-only readable text representation of the\nspinner's meaning inside the component using Bootstrap's `visually-hidden`\nclass.\n\nThe example below provides an example of accessible usage of this\ncomponent.",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
